#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/openssl.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"is a <application>Perl</application> script that scans all files in a "
"directory and adds symbolic links to their hash values.  Use of "
"<command>c_rehash</command> is considered obsolete and should be replaced by"
" <command>openssl rehash</command> command"
msgstr ""
"é um script <application>Perl</application> que escaneia todos os arquivos "
"em um diretório e adiciona links simbólicos para os valores de hash deles. O"
" uso do <command>c_rehash</command> é considerado obsoleto e deveria ser "
"substituído pelo comando <command>openssl rehash</command>"

